    "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now." : {
      "comment" : "Panel ▸ Display card: Safe on an Apple XDR panel in bright surroundings",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Segur” es manté al nivell que aquesta pantalla pot mantenir a tota la superfície. En un entorn lluminós, el macOS ja mostra el blanc així de brillant, per això ara “Segur” no hi afegeix res."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Limit „Bezpečný“ odpovídá úrovni, kterou tento monitor udrží na celé obrazovce. V jasném okolí už macOS zobrazuje bílou takto jasně, takže „Bezpečný“ teď nic nepřidává."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grænsen Sikker er det niveau, skærmen kan holde over hele fladen. I lyse omgivelser viser macOS allerede hvid med den lysstyrke, så Sikker tilføjer ikke noget lige nu."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„Sicher“ bleibt auf der Stufe, die dieses Display auf dem ganzen Bildschirm halten kann. In heller Umgebung zeigt macOS Weiß bereits so hell an, daher fügt „Sicher“ derzeit nichts hinzu."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Seguro” se queda en el nivel que esta pantalla puede mantener en toda su superficie. Con mucha luz ambiental, macOS ya muestra el blanco así de brillante, así que ahora “Seguro” no añade nada."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« Sécurité » reste au niveau que cet écran peut tenir sur toute sa surface. Dans un environnement lumineux, macOS affiche déjà un blanc aussi lumineux : « Sécurité » n’ajoute donc rien pour le moment."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Sigurno” ostaje na razini koju ovaj zaslon može održati na cijeloj površini. U svijetloj okolini macOS već prikazuje tako svijetlu bijelu, pa “Sigurno” sada ništa ne dodaje."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Sicuro” resta al livello che questo schermo può mantenere su tutta la superficie. Con molta luce ambientale macOS mostra già il bianco così luminoso, quindi ora “Sicuro” non aggiunge nulla."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«Trygg» holder seg på nivået denne skjermen kan holde over hele skjermflaten. I lyse omgivelser viser macOS allerede så lyst hvitt, så «Trygg» legger ikke til noe nå."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "‘Veilig’ blijft op het niveau dat dit beeldscherm over het hele scherm kan vasthouden. In een lichte omgeving toont macOS wit al zo helder, dus ‘Veilig’ voegt nu niets toe."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Limit „Bezpieczny” to poziom, który ten wyświetlacz może utrzymać na całym ekranie. Przy jasnym otoczeniu macOS już wyświetla biel o takiej jasności, więc teraz limit „Bezpieczny” niczego nie dodaje."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Seguro” fica no nível que esta tela consegue manter em toda a superfície. Em ambientes muito claros, o macOS já mostra o branco com esse brilho, então “Seguro” não adiciona nada agora."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Seguro” fica no nível que este monitor consegue manter em todo o ecrã. Com luz ambiente intensa, o macOS já mostra o branco com esse brilho, por isso “Seguro” não acrescenta nada agora."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„Sigur” rămâne la nivelul pe care acest afișaj îl poate menține pe tot ecranul. În medii luminoase, macOS afișează deja un alb atât de luminos, așa că „Sigur” nu adaugă nimic acum."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Предел «Безопасно» — уровень, который этот дисплей может держать на всём экране. При ярком окружающем свете macOS уже показывает белый такой яркости, поэтому сейчас «Безопасно» ничего не добавляет."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Limit „Bezpečný“ zodpovedá úrovni, ktorú tento displej udrží na celej obrazovke. V jasnom prostredí už macOS zobrazuje bielu takto jasne, takže „Bezpečný“ teraz nič nepridáva."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Omejitev »Varno« ustreza ravni, ki jo ta zaslon vzdrži na celotni površini. V svetli okolici macOS že prikazuje tako svetlo belo, zato »Varno« zdaj ne doda ničesar."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gränsen Säker ligger på den nivå som skärmen kan hålla över hela ytan. I ljus omgivning visar macOS redan så ljust vitt, så Säker tillför inget just nu."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Межа «Безпечно» — рівень, який цей дисплей може тримати на всьому екрані. За яскравого навколишнього світла macOS уже показує білий такої яскравості, тож зараз «Безпечно» нічого не додає."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Safe stays at the level this display can hold across the whole screen. In bright surroundings macOS already shows white that bright, so Safe adds nothing now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
