    "macOS allows %@ right now. It lowers the extra range when the surroundings are bright, the display is warm or the battery is low." : {
      "comment" : "Panel ▸ Display card: popover of Limited by macOS; the argument is a multiplier such as ×1.55",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
